# Elysicester is the front door now. Its old address, however a phone keyboard capitalises it, still finds it.
# (Cloudflare matches paths case by case, so each spelling is listed, with and without its slash.)
/elysicester / 301
/Elysicester / 301
/Elysicester/ / 301
/ELYSICESTER / 301
/ELYSICESTER/ / 301

# The city's plain page gave way to its texts, both works whole on one page: an old link to it still finds them.
/elysicester/plainly.html /read.html 301
/elysicester/plainly /read.html 301

# Everything that was under /elysicester/ is now at the top, at the same name.
/elysicester/* /:splat 301

# The city's code, at an address that changes whenever the code does (scripts/stamp-elysicester.mjs),
# so a browser that kept yesterday's scripts still meets today's city.
/v/:stamp/* /:splat 200
